  "id": "USN-8117-1",
  "summary": "strongswan vulnerability",
  "details": "Kazuma Matsumoto discovered that strongSwan incorrectly handled EAP-TTLS\nAVPs when using the eap-ttls plugin. An attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause strongSwan to consume resources and crash, resulting in a\ndenial of service.",
